## Deprecation playbook

When a tool here is deprecated or its interface changes:

1. Confirm on the project's own docs/changelog (not a search result).
2. Update the pin in `mise.toml` and this page in the same change.
3. Note the migration in `docs/experiments.md` as a `[harness]` entry.

